        rules: {
          objective: "Beat the dealer's hand total without going over 21. A hand total of 21 is best; player 21 always wins, including against dealer blackjack.",
          gameplay: 'Players place a bet. Dealer gives two cards to each player and two to himself (one dealer card face-up). Players act in turn: hit (draw), stand (pass), double down, split pairs, or surrender. Player 21 always wins. Player blackjack beats dealer blackjack. Late surrender and double-after-split are allowed. Dealer then plays according to house rules (hit or stand on soft 17). Hands are compared; higher total without busting wins. Bonuses pay for 6-7-8, 7-7-7, and multi-card 21.',
          keyRules: [
            'Spanish deck: 48 cards (no 10s); face cards count 10.',
            'Late surrender allowed. Double after split and re-split aces allowed.',
            'Player may double on any number of cards. Hit and double after splitting aces (where offered).',
            'Surrender after doubling (double down rescue) forfeits original bet.',
            'Five-card 21 pays 3:2; six-card 21 pays 2:1; seven-plus-card 21 pays 3:1.',
            '6-7-8 or 7-7-7 mixed suits 3:2; same suit 2:1; spades 3:1. Suited 7-7-7 vs dealer 7 pays Super Bonus.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: "Do not use standard Blackjack strategy! The missing 10s change the math significantly. You hit more often on stiff hands (12-16) because the bust card (10) is gone. You double less often against dealer's 2-6 because dealer is less likely to bust.",
          intermediate: "Surrender: Use the 'Double Rescue' option freely if your double goes bad (e.g., Doubling 11, getting a 2 for 13 against a dealer Ace? Surrender).",
          advanced: 'Bonus Hunting: Sometimes hitting a hard 14 (composed of 7-7) against a dealer 6 is correct to fish for the third 7.',
          tips: [
            'Never split 10s (Face cards).',
            'Always hit 12 vs 2-3.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
